class="feat-sec-subheading"> Features</div><div
class="feat-sec-heading"> Control All Flash Calls on Your Network</div></div><div
class="feat-sec-supporting-text"> Most mobile operators don't charge for flash calls, benefiting only OTTs and enterprises who use them. With Devotel's Voice Monetisation Solution you can have full control of flash calls made on your network, enabling you to monetise authentication traffic while maintaining competitive pricing and service quality.</div></div><div
